Package: vpndetection
Version: 0.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mslm Dev <support@vpndetection.io>
Homepage: https://vpndetection.io
Description: Official CLI for the VPNDetection API
 Look up what an IP address is - a VPN exit, a hosting or CDN range, a Tor
 node, a privacy relay, or a residential, datacenter or mobile proxy - one
 address at a time or in bulk, and download the licensed datasets.
